        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel with polychrome floral or cone forms on a gold background; complementary weft 3/1 plain weave.The panel is enclosed by four pieces of bias-woven borders flowers and birds on a metal ground. The guard strips are pierced silk satin. The entire panel is backed with a floral block print on cotton. The edge is light brown with twill woven silk fabric."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/de5bf34e-8980-3b7d-8d0d-31bd2361e8a4> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel with polychrome floral or cone forms on a gold background; complementary weft 3/1 plain weave.The panel is enclosed by four pieces of bias-woven borders flowers and birds on a metal ground. The guard strips are pierced silk satin. The entire panel is backed with a floral block print on cotton. The edge is light brown with twill woven silk fabric."@en ;
